# ============================================================================
# Gimboot — Cloudflare redirect rules (Pages + Workers static assets)
#
# This file must live in the deployed static-asset root (this directory).
# Static rules are listed before dynamic rules; the first match wins.
# Query strings are preserved by Cloudflare's asset redirect engine, so
# /game.html?id=gm-123 becomes /game?id=gm-123 (the ?id= value survives).
#
# NOTE: redirects in this file are NOT applied to requests served directly
# by src/index.js. The Worker enforces the same rules in code so production
# behaviour does not depend on asset-layer routing (see Task #032).
# ============================================================================

# 1. Root document -> clean root URL
/index.html / 301
/index.htm / 301

# 2. Legacy game shell -> clean game route (query string preserved)
/game.html /game 301
/game.html/ /game 301
/game.html* /game 301
